= Battle Against the Merchant Corps

The CPC has lately organized labour and peasant unions, joined with 50,000 people, they have issued a warning to Chen Lianbo and his Merchant Corps. Led by Zhou Enlai, they have sworn their loyalty to the revolutionary government and have called for Chen Lianbo's death.
The Merchant Corps have retaliated massively and have begun defenses in Xiguan. Notices saying "Beat Sun's Government" have spread around the area.

- @beat: Send Chiang Kai-shek's Whampoa Cadets over!

@beat
on-arrival: whampoa_strength += 5; economic_growth -= 0.35;
face-image: img/cantonburn.jpg

After organizing a quick revolutionary council, Chiang Kai-shek and his Whampoa Academy cadets have defeated the Merchant Corps rebellion!

Although our government can go back to business, Xiguan has burned due to a fire. This will take some time to heal.
